B.Nt=new A.oR("04","Today \u2764\ufe0f","And here we are","Today, when I look at us, I still feel grateful that somehow our paths crossed. From being strangers, to friends, to becoming two people who mean so much to each other, I never imagined our story would come this far.\n\nI love what we have today. The little conversations, the silly moments, the laughs, the comfort of having you beside me, and even the difficult days that we get through together. I don\u2019t need everything to be perfect. I just want us to keep choosing each other, again and again.\n\nAnd for our future, I don\u2019t know exactly where life will take us. But I hope I\u2019ll still be beside you through all of it. I want to make more memories with you, grow together, support each other, and one day look back at everything we\u2019ve been through and say, \u201cWe really made it.\u201d\n\nI hope this isn\u2019t just a beautiful chapter of my life. I hope you\u2019ll be part of the whole story. \u2764\ufe0f","assets/img/today.jpg")
B.Nu=new A.oR("02","Our First Conversation","Where everything started","Sayang, actually at first I really thought you weren\u2019t interested in me. \ud83d\ude02 You seemed a little dry, and I wondered if I was the only one who wanted to keep talking.\n\nBut it made sense because you were already in a relationship at that time. Still, somehow, I just wanted to keep talking to you. There was something about you that made me not want to stop.\n\nAnd honestly, you were a little bit jual mahal too. \ud83d\ude02 But once I really wanted something, I\u2019d always try my best to get it. And somehow\u2026 I got you. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nLooking back, it\u2019s funny how the girl I thought was so hard to approach eventually became the girl I love this much. I guess that\u2019s why I\u2019ll always treasure how our story began. \u2764\ufe0f","assets/img/first_conv.jpg")
B.Nv=new A.oR("01","The Day We Met","A day I will always remember","Sayang, I never knew that meeting you would eventually become one of the most beautiful parts of my life. At first, I thought you would just be my \u201chi-bye\u201d friend, but I was so wrong. \ud83d\ude02\n\nHonestly, from that first meeting, I already found you really cute, funny, and somehow we had the same energy. But after that day, we barely talked at all. It was only Dinie who became our middle woman and somehow brought us closer.\n\nThat\u2019s why I really value that first meeting. Because even though it was just a simple moment, I never knew that the person I met that day would eventually become someone so special to me. If I could go back, I would still choose to meet you that day, because that little moment was the beginning of my favourite story \u2014 us. \u2764\ufe0f","assets/img/first_met.jpeg")
B.Nw=new A.oR("03","The Moment I Realised","Somewhere along the way","Somewhere along the way, I started to realise how much I loved you. Our laughs, our little moments, and how close we became back then slowly made me fall for you.\n\nIt was never because I pitied your relationship. I knew you were better than that, and I believed there must have been something that led you to where you were.\n\nThe truth is, we were never really serious about being together at first. We just followed the flow and enjoyed having each other around. But somewhere along the way, my feelings became real.\n\nAnd then I realised\u2026 you were the one I had been looking for all along. \u2764\ufe0f","assets/img/day_realise.jpg")
